🔍 1. MSSQL Connection & Troubleshooting

  
Tool Used: `impacket-mssqlclient` (v0.13.0.dev0)

  

Initial Command Attempts (Common Pitfalls)

```bash

❌ Failed - missing @ separator

impacket-mssqlclient kevin:'iNa2we6haRj2gaw!' -target-ip 10.10.11.252

  

❌ Failed - space before @ (argparse error)

impacket-mssqlclient kevin:'iNa2we6haRj2gaw!' @10.10.11.252

# Error: unrecognized arguments: @xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx

Corrected Command

impacket-mssqlclient kevin:'iNa2we6haRj2gaw!'@10.10.11.252

or with hostname + IP override

impacket-mssqlclient kevin:'iNa2we6haRj2gaw!'@eighteen.htb -target-ip 10.10.11.252

Lesson: Impacket expects a single positional argument in the format username:password@target. Spaces break argparse.

